        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, well… That’s a bit more direct that I was imagining.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> says, blushing slightly as he and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> witness this scene. <span style="Color: Pink">You let out a cry of discomfort and instantly straighten up, your personal space invaded by his prodding finger. Your voice is high-pitched as you cry out and try to push him away from you. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>, expecting this reaction, breaks out laughing.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry, guess I got lost in my character.”</span> He says as an excuse, smirking. <span style="Color: Pink">He wiggles his slightly damp finger at you as you cover your butt, as red as you’ve ever been.</span> <span style="Color: LightCoral">You are about to say something when <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> suddenly tackles <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> to the ground and they both begin to tussle on the ground.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You perverted little-!”</span> <span style="Color: Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> cries out as you are left stunned watching this nude wrestling match.</span> <span style="Color: Yellow"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> jumps to his feet and tries to get them to stop, but can only watch as the fighting boys tumble off the stage into the stands. The fighting only stops as he grabs both of them by their hair and drags them to their feet.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Enough!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> shouts as both boys cringe from the pain, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You are lucky your performance was so good, else I would be giving you another detention!”</span> He sighs dramatically, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“such a beautiful display marred by your senseless bickering. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. $Player.LastName</span>, you may get dressed and are free to go. You two, on the other hand, will be mopping the stage and dusting the backroom! And for every word I hear out of your mouth I will be keeping you here another 10 minutes and turning the AC down another few degrees. Understood?”</span> <br>
        <br>
        Both boys look at each other nervously, <span style="Color: Pink">realizing that AC and nudity don’t mix well. Blushing, they both nod obediently. As much as you would love to watch them both clean nude in a large chilly room, you think it best to get dressed and get out of there before you are dragged into any more of their nonsense.</span> Those two really need to learn to get along. <br>
        <br>
        The bright side, at least, is you can tease <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> about this later. <br>
